WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Hello, and welcome to my Employee Management API project.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:11.000
This project is built using Node.js, Express.js, and PostgreSQL.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.500
It follows a modular architecture, with organized routes, controllers, and services.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:26.000
The API supports retrieving employee records, creating new employees, and handling requests with proper validation and error handling.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.200
This project demonstrates my practical backend development skills.

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:32.000
Thank you for watching!
